  "label": "Lion declaring defiance against conformity",
  "description": "The scene centers on a male lion with an aggressive, defiant expression, baring its teeth and narrowing its eyes. This visual is juxtaposed with text that criticizes 'most people' as conformists and declares 'I'm not one of those people.' The lion's posture and expression symbolize strength and non-conformity, creating a scene of symbolic declaration. The lion is the sole participant, and its expression and the text together form a narrative of resistance.",
